WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.851
Today we will communicate ideas through body movement. Our work connects with

00:00:04.851 --> 00:00:07.176
selected artists and traditions in Ghana.

00:00:08.033 --> 00:00:13.394
Choose a character and identify one important action. Name a design choice that a

00:00:13.394 --> 00:00:15.308
selected Ghanaian artist might make.

00:00:16.117 --> 00:00:19.466
Try three gestures that communicate the action without words.

00:00:20.283 --> 00:00:23.718
Show your gesture sequence while a friend identifies the story.
